    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="brand" aria-label="SnapFrame home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>SnapFrame</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">About</a>
        <a href="index.html">Features</a>
        <a href="index.html">Safety</a>
        <a href="index.html">Creators</a>
        <a href="index.html">News</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="header-actions">
        <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-login">Log in</a>
        <button class="hamburger" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobileMenu">
          <span></span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" role="dialog" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
        <nav>
          <a href="index.html">About</a>
          <a href="index.html">Features</a>
          <a href="index.html">Safety</a>
          <a href="index.html">Creators</a>
          <a href="index.html">News</a>
          <a href="index.html">Log in</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero container" id="hero">
      <div class="hero-wrap">
        <h1>SnapFrame brings you closer to the people and things you love</h1>
        <p>SnapFrame is a social media platform that makes it easy to capture, create, and share what you love with the people who matter most.</p>
        <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-primary">Try it now</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container" id="features">
      <div class="split">
        <article class="panel">
          <h2>Share what you're into with the people who get you with all our features →</h2>
          <p>SnapFrame's suite of creative tools — from short-form video to disappearing stories and direct messaging — lets you express yourself and connect with the communities that matter most. Explore Clips, Stories, DMs, and Search &amp; Explore to find your people.</p>
          <a href="index.html">features →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="panel safety" id="safety">
          <h2>Protect your account and peace-of-mind with our safety tools →</h2>
          <p>SnapFrame is committed to keeping every member of our community safe. Our safety tools give you control over your experience — from content filters and restricted accounts to privacy settings and reporting features designed to protect your well-being.</p>
          <a href="index.html">safety tools →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="panel creators" id="creators">
          <h2>Entertain, inspire and reach new audiences as a creator ↗</h2>
          <p>Whether you're just starting out or already have a following, SnapFrame gives creators the tools to grow, monetize, and connect with fans. Build your brand, collaborate with others, and turn your passion into opportunity.</p>
          <a href="index.html">creator ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container">
      <div class="tagline">Where everyday moments bring friends together</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container" id="news">
      <div class="news-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">News</div>
          <h2>Discover more about SnapFrame</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="index.html">View more</a>
      </div>

      <div class="carousel" aria-label="SnapFrame news carousel">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="thumb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">#ANNOUNCEMENTS</span></div>
            <h3>Close Friends Only Podcast — Maya Lin, Kylie Torres, and Aidan Reyes are the Moment on SnapFrame's "Close Friends Only" Podcast</h3>
            <div class="date">February 18, 2026</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="thumb" aria-hidden="true" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b37f5, #b64ad8 60%, #ff7a00);"></div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">#TIPS &amp; TRICKS</span><span class="tag">#PRODUCT</span></div>
            <h3>Sticker Ideas and Tips for Finding the Best Ones — SnapFrame Sticker Ideas and Tips for Finding the Best Ones</h3>
            <div class="date">February 4, 2026</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="thumb" aria-hidden="true" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5c2ee4, #7f32d6 46%, #ff8d28);"></div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">#PRODUCT</span><span class="tag">#ANNOUNCEMENTS</span></div>
            <h3>Watch Reels on the Big Screen — Introducing SnapFrame for TV: Watch Clips on the Big Screen</h3>
            <div class="date">December 17, 2025</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="thumb" aria-hidden="true" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7638FA, #9f59ff 45%, #ff9f3d);"></div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">#ANNOUNCEMENTS</span><span class="tag">#SAFETY</span></div>
            <h3>Carversations: Real Parent-Teen Talks About Social Media</h3>
            <div class="date">December 12, 2025</div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container">
      <div class="download">
        <div>
          <h2>Create, share and connect.</h2>
          <p>Download now.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="download-actions">
          <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-store">App Store</a>
          <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-store">Google Play</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-col"><h3>About</h3><a href="index.html">Our story</a><a href="index.html">Leadership</a><a href="index.html">Brand</a><a href="index.html">Brand kit ↗</a><a href="index.html">Working at SnapFrame</a><a href="index.html">Politics ↗</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h3>Features</h3><a href="index.html">Clips</a><a href="index.html">Stories</a><a href="index.html">DMs</a><a href="index.html">Search &amp; Explore</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h3>Safety</h3><a href="index.html">Safety tools</a><a href="index.html">Privacy tools</a><a href="index.html">Account security</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h3>Community</h3><a href="index.html">School Partnerships</a><a href="index.html">Teen Accounts</a><a href="index.html">Anti-Bullying</a><a href="index.html">Parents</a><a href="index.html">Programs</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h3>External</h3><a href="index.html">Threads ↗</a><a href="index.html">Edits ↗</a><a href="index.html">Business ↗</a><a href="index.html">Creators ↗</a><a href="index.html">News ↗</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h3>Partners</h3><a href="index.html">Meta ↗</a><a href="index.html">Family Center ↗</a><a href="index.html">Help Center ↗</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <div>English (US)</div>
        <div class="socials" aria-label="Social links">
          <span class="icon">SF</span><span class="icon">Fb</span><span class="icon">Th</span><span class="icon">YT</span><span class="icon">X</span><span class="icon">in</span>
        </div>
        <div>API · Privacy · Terms · Sitemap</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const menuToggle = document.getElementById('menuToggle');
    const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobileMenu');
    menuToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const isOpen = mobileMenu.classList.toggle('open');
      menuToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(isOpen));
      menuToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', isOpen ? 'Close menu' : 'Open menu');
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
